WEBVTT

00:01:29.863 --> 00:01:35.180
is to focus on deeper human values
and the rich connections between us.

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:38.485
(Recorded talk) David Brooks:
We no longer feel good about ourselves

00:01:38.509 --> 00:01:39.667
as a people.

00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:41.770
We've lost our defining
faith in our future.

00:01:41.794 --> 00:01:44.921
We don't see each other deeply,
we don't treat each other as well.

00:01:44.945 --> 00:01:46.333
And we need a lot of changes.

00:01:46.357 --> 00:01:48.681
We need economic change
and environmental change.

00:01:48.705 --> 00:01:51.266
But we also need a cultural
and relational revolution.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.640
And to me, the weavers
have found that language.

00:01:55.563 --> 00:02:00.799
CA: In this episode, David and I are going
to explore how these new ideas connect,